  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Unstamped Wool Glove Liners offer versatile cold weather protection. These glove liners are thin enough to serve as a layer under other gloves, yet warm enough to be worn on their own. Made in the USA with quality craftsmanship, they provide reliable warmth without compromising mobility. The unstamped design adds to their versatility, making them suitable for various outdoor activities. These liners are compatible with D-3A shells, offering added convenience for users.</p>",
